Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-ecm: support the Linux 6.18 timer API

Preserve timer cancellation and callback behavior on existing kernels.
Map the removed timer aliases to their equivalents for Linux 6.18.

---
--- a/ecm_db/ecm_db_timer.c
+++ b/ecm_db/ecm_db_timer.c
@@ -521,5 +521,9 @@ void ecm_db_timer_exit(void)
 	 * as we would wait for the callback to finish and it would wait
 	 * indefinately for the lock to be released!
 	 */
+#if LINUX_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 18, 0)
+	timer_delete_sync(&ecm_db_timer);
+#else
 	del_timer_sync(&ecm_db_timer);
+#endif
 }
